---
layout: base.njk
title: Circular Steel USA
description: Supporting the next frontier of steel reuse across North America.
permalink: /usa/
region: usa
---
{% from "sponsor-grid.njk" import sponsorGrid %}
<section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Supporting the next frontier of steel reuse</h1>
    <p class="lede">Circular Steel USA builds on UK leadership to support the growth of structural steel reuse across North America. As interest accelerates in embodied carbon reduction, Circular Steel USA provides a focused forum for practitioners, owners and policymakers seeking practical pathways to deliver reuse projects.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
    <div class="card dark" style="display:inline-block; text-align:left; max-width:520px;">
      <div class="meta">Next event</div>
      <h3>Circular Steel USA 2027</h3>
      <p>15&ndash;16 April 2027 &middot; Denver, CO. More info coming soon &mdash; hold the date, and get in touch if you want to be part of it.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:14px;"><a class="btn on-dark solid-white" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wash">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title"><span class="kicker">Focus</span>Connecting global expertise</h2>
    <p class="prose" style="margin-bottom:20px;">The platform brings together:</p>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="card"><p>US project leaders and asset owners</p></div>
      <div class="card"><p>UK practitioners sharing proven experience</p></div>
      <div class="card"><p>Engineers, fabricators and demolition specialists</p></div>
      <div class="card"><p>Policy leaders and sustainability experts</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="prose" style="margin-top:28px;">Together, they explore how global lessons can accelerate regional market readiness. <strong>A practical, practitioner-led forum.</strong> Circular Steel USA prioritises real-world delivery, connecting those designing, procuring and delivering projects with reuse ambitions.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% set usaPartners = programmePartners.usa | resolveSponsors(collections.sponsors, collections.tiers) %}
{% if usaPartners.length %}
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title"><span class="kicker">Backed by</span>Our Sponsors</h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      {{ sponsorGrid(usaPartners, collections.tiers) }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% set usaEvents = collections.events | byRegion("usa") %}
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title"><span class="kicker">Most recent</span>Previous USA events</h2>
    <div class="grid-2">
      {% for event in usaEvents %}
        {% if loop.index0 < 2 %}
        <a class="event-feature" href="{{ event.url }}">
          <div class="ef-media">
            {% if event.data.image %}<img src="{{ event.data.image }}" alt="{{ event.data.title }}">{% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="ef-body">
            <span class="tag status-past">{{ event.data.year }}</span>
            <h3>{{ event.data.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ event.data.summary }}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% if usaEvents.length > 2 %}
<section class="wash">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title"><span class="kicker">Archive</span>Earlier USA events</h2>
    <div class="archive-list">
      {% for event in usaEvents %}
        {% if loop.index0 >= 2 %}
        <a class="archive-row" href="{{ event.url }}">
          <span class="yr">{{ event.data.year }}</span>
          <span class="at">{{ event.data.title }}</span>
          <span class="as">{{ event.data.summary }}</span>
        </a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
